A test for correctness that all ((lujvo)) must pass.  ''Tosmabru'' is a hypothetical lujvo, as if from tos+mabru, that fails the test: it falls apart into "to smabru".  To fix this, a ''y'' hyphen is inserted, leading to the morphologically correct lujvo ''tosymabru''.

Full details are available at [http://www.lojban.org/files/reference-grammar/chap4.html#s11].
